WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Sedzani hune muya wa maanḓa, wo omaho wa bva hone.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Ṱavhani ni tshi pfuka muya, thungo ine wa bva khayo.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Itani mutevhe mulapfu u si na zwikhala. Muya u ṱavhanya u tshi pfuka tshikhala.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Litshani muya muṅwe u pfuke miri. Murahu ha luvhondo lwo khwaṱhaho muya u a mona.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Vheani miri milapfu thungo ya muya, ya vhukati vhukati, na zwiṱaka zwipfufhi phanḓa.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Siyani tshikhala vhukati ha miri na zwiliṅwa uri tshedza tshi swike kha ndima.
